{"overview":"با مارکو آشنا شوید، یک دختر مدرسه‌ای شیرین که با جرعه‌ای فراوان کنجکاوی (و گاهی بی‌تفاوتی) زندگی می‌کند! او در شهر کوچکی دلپذیر همراه با والدین، پدربزرگ و مادربزرگ، و خواهرش زندگی می‌کند. مارکو گروهی از دوستان وفادار دارد، از جمله نزدیک‌ترین دوستش، تاما-چان، اما پدربزرگ بازیگوش و مهربان او در مرکز تمام این اتفاقات قرار دارد. زندگی در این سری جذاب هرگز خسته‌کننده نیست.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Meet Maruko, a sweet schoolgirl with a hefty dose of curiosity (and occasional laziness!). She sails through life in a cozy town alongside her loving parents, grandparents, and sister. Maruko has a band of loyal friends, including her closest pal, Tama-chan, but her playful and doting grandpa is at the heart of it all. Life is never dull in this charming series.","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":32,"y":1991,"poster":"/4qCL1eTgtJfxAO7HuUbqFDAqwp5.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":142,"y":1990,"poster":"/9K0IWDhwMSLesDmtS2kTaWtJ47B.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":1550,"y":1995,"poster":"/7XqzQEcXxwYf70CPxDojf7JQrwO.jpg"}],"episodes":1691,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"TARAKO","role":"Momoko 'Maruko' Sakura (voice)","photo":"/dIju4JSkZem6Yaep5RYLWfTmp1P.jpg"},{"name":"یکو میزوتانی","role":"Sakiko Sakura (voice)","photo":"/wjuj1u5aqjHEGqDo6FMScwWFKqP.jpg","en":"Yuko Mizutani"},{"name":"屋良有作","role":"Hiroshi Sakura (voice)","photo":"/73cpMM1uWJiiZ1u4BymUQmTb22j.jpg","en":"Yusaku Yara"},{"name":"一龍斎貞友","role":"Sumire Sakura (voice)","photo":"/23NrErvp0tFXWJxKMumfDKhR0Ms.jpg","en":"Teiyu Ichiryusai"},{"name":"青野武","role":"Tomozo Sakura (voice)","photo":"/e3IaulH39g31sTIZuiUsXXc5iZj.jpg","en":"Takeshi Aono"},{"name":"佐々木優子","role":"Kotake Sakura (voice)","photo":"/acaWGcmtdPC1Q0NmHcy7fvdjmUO.jpg","en":"Yuko Sasaki"},{"name":"渡辺菜生子","role":"Tamae Honami (voice)","photo":"/wgX2xT2y21Tv0eKIMSyMXf6CC0U.jpg","en":"Naoko Watanabe"},{"name":"菊池正美","role":"Kazuhiko Hanawa (voice)","phot